":1,"platformText":"1. 盡速推動確認捷運路廊、務必及早通過環境影響評估、讓捷運工程進度早日落實、以帶動地方繁榮。\n2. 督促市府落實長照 2.0 及降低公辦幼托收費政策、敦使民間疾苦充分改善。\n3. 北五堵研發新鎮進度一直落後，未來將督促市府加緊規劃進度、以期地方因而共榮共享、並遏止人口外移及造就\n更多就業機會。\n4. 監督市府落實路要平、水要通、燈要亮的基本建設政策，使基隆成為一個既宜居又友善的城市。\n5. 爭取更多經費淘汰老式監視系统，品質提昇、數量務必需要增加以彌補警力不足，確保人民居家環境安全。\n6. 在中央政策山坡地比例對基隆解編放寬後，將建議市府能借此機會簡化手續及開放既有道路用地販售，做為容積\n移轉之條件，推動都市更新案件使多數危老能更新改建。","reviewDecision":{"version":"internal-platform-review-ui-v2","decision":"approve","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T07:36:25.757Z"},"sourceDocument":{"url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/06%E7%B8%A3%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1/111%E5%B9%B4/20%E5%9F%BA%E9%9A%86%E5%B8%82/%E7%AC%AC7%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%80/%E5%9F%BA%E9%9A%86%E5%B8%82%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1_%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E9%81%B8%E5%8D%80.pdf","file":"tmp/cec-representative-platforms/2022-councilor/pdfs/95cd0a4791353858eebbd530.pdf","page":1,"sha256":"c2e6e99d8be61f2356747763c834e2cfb77cee5f28fa0e1e906e697246c6fb5e","cropFile":"tmp/cec-representative-platforms/2022-councilor/crops-1/f4794144-15bb-4104-a9fa-7612e457d0b9-c2e6e99d8be61f23-3b523dc86e2b.png","layoutFile":"tmp/cec-representative-platforms/2022-councilor/layouts-1/f4794144-15bb-4104-a9fa-7612e457d0b9-c2e6e99d8be61f23.png","extractionMethod":"ocr_ready_table_geometry"},"electionContext":{"raceId":"f9ecc03c-b22e-4263-92aa-fb864fb5353c","electionId":"9947ae7e-c242-4911-bcf3-72d2f0f5517d","candidateId":"f4794144-15bb-4104-a9fa-7612e457d0b9"},"publicationGate":{"reason":"Election-scoped CEC platform text accepted; minor transcription errors may remain","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T07:36:25.757Z"},"campaignPlatformReview":{"reason":"Exact person and candidacy were confirmed before publication","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T07:36:25.757Z"}},"confidence_level":"B","review_status":"verified","visibility":"public","source_name":"中央選舉委員會：2022年選舉公報","source_url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/06%E7%B8%A3%E5%B8%82%E8