核，看緊人民荷包，做人與政府溝通的橋樑。\n2、爭取資源：連結中央部會與國會資源，推動地方建設發展。\n3、世代共融：推動「老幼共學」課程計畫，打造進階長者照護模式。\n4、長者健康：推動各社區據點裝設AED（自動體外心臟去顫器），於緊急狀況時爭取急救時間。\n5、兒童遊戲安全：重視共融式、口袋公園遊具的安全管理維護，為孩子遊戲安全嚴格把關。\n6、重大交通建設：加速屏東縣內各項重大交通建設規劃期程、以及施工進度。\n7、亮點觀光：盤點屏東市觀光資源，並結合各文創園區（勝利新村、屏菸1936文化基地、大武營文創園區），建構完整的屏東市觀光地圖。\n8、青年就業：透過屏東科學園區促進產業升級，增加高薪就業機會，讓青年不再北漂。\n9、環境永續：推動「太陽能面板回收機制」，以行動落實環境永續發展。\n10、空汙防制：持續推動制定《跨縣市空汙防制計畫》，力求有效減緩屏東嚴重空汙。\n11、照顧農民：強化農、漁產品冷鏈系統，整合內、外產銷系統，搭建國際農、漁特產品銷售平台。","reviewDecision":{"version":"codex-local-platform-review-v1","decision":"approve","reviewedAt":"2026-08-20T07:17:27.747Z"},"sourceDocument":{"url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/06%E7%B8%A3%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1/111%E5%B9%B4/13%E5%B1%8F%E6%9D%B1%E7%B8%A3/%E5%B1%8F%E6%9D%B1%E7%B8%A3%E7%AC%AC01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%801.pdf","file":"tmp/cec-representative-platforms/2022-councilor/pdfs/511b483425ee472b0e5ac84c.pdf","page":1,"sha256":"449718253f8db87d6eec3403754a97ee094ab80b1a01ddf58c9365022c1cbc8c","layoutFile":null,"extractionMethod":"needs_manual_localization"},"electionContext":{"raceId":"6e735693-ba2c-4e7c-8617-1ad19b5f5195","electionId":"9947ae7e-c242-4911-bcf3-72d2f0f5517d","candidateId":"b3b270bb-4884-465f-8747-fc73d891adcd"},"publicationGate":{"reason":"Election-scoped CEC platform text accepted; minor transcription errors may remain","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-20T07:17:27.747Z"},"transcriptionEvidence":{"method":"verified_official_row_geometry_and_visual_transcription","cropFile":"tmp/cec-representative-platforms/2022-councilor/recovered-platform-crops-second-batch/b3b270bb-4884-465f-8747-fc73d891adcd.png"},"campaignPlatformReview":{"reason":"Exact person, candidate row, and election-scoped CEC bulletin platform cell were visually confirmed","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-20T07:17:27.747Z"}},"confidence_level":"B","review_status":"verified","visibility":"public","source_name":"中央選舉委員會：2022年選舉公報","source_url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85