, 提高使用安全性及使用效益。\n五、 積極爭取在東區設置 「英語村」, 提供國中小學生更多的學者機會 , 提升學生的國際視野。\n六、 整合嘉義市醫療資源 , 推動多元化 「老人照護計劃」。\n七、 加強落實婦幼保護政策 , 提供不幸婦女第二專長訓練及輔導就業。\n八、 推動落實兩性平權 , 提升女性職場功能價值。\n九、 防範毒品、 色情等惡考入侵家庭、 校園 , 以創造優質生活環境。\n十、 督促衛生單位加強食物品管監控 , 確保市民飲食健康。\n十一、 加強建構社區防護網 , 以確保市民居住品質。\n十二、 爭取於東西區各設置一座寵物公園。\n十三、 爭取關建國際規格滑板場。\n十四、 推動將情緒教育納入國中小教育課程 ; 並將國中小教師納入情緒教育的課程訓練中 , 讓嘉義市的情緒教育從家庭到學校 , 全方位無死\n角。\n十五、 推動全面加速汰換全市國中小教室傳統燈具 , 達到節能省電成效 , 改善學童視力狀況。","reviewDecision":{"version":"internal-platform-review-ui-v2","decision":"approve","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T07:36:29.043Z"},"sourceDocument":{"url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/06%E7%B8%A3%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1/111%E5%B9%B4/22%E5%98%89%E7%BE%A9%E5%B8%82/%E5%98%89%E7%BE%A9%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC1%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%80.pdf","file":"tmp/cec-representative-platforms/2022-councilor/pdfs/b3c01bfb31e6ffa2ff7d2042.pdf","page":1,"sha256":"6a367b4e6fb63d2b260b46831a6a5decfc6c1589732e16f3c8cb572ab84eba87","layoutFile":null,"extractionMethod":"needs_manual_localization"},"electionContext":{"raceId":"a38bd5eb-3faa-4b93-a781-10a60490ed9e","electionId":"9947ae7e-c242-4911-bcf3-72d2f0f5517d","candidateId":"5d6141a5-ac92-4c64-9426-b9d96e82db10"},"publicationGate":{"reason":"Election-scoped CEC platform text accepted; minor transcription errors may remain","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T07:36:29.043Z"},"campaignPlatformReview":{"reason":"Exact person and candidacy were confirmed before publication","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T07:36:29.043Z"}},"confidence_level":"C","review_status":"verified","visibility":"public","source_name":"中央選舉委員會：2022年選舉公報","source_url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/06%E7%B8%A3%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1/111%E5%B9%B4/22%E5%98%89%E7%BE%A9%E5%B8%82/%E5%98%89%E7%BE%A9%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC1%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%80.pdf","observed_at":"2022-11-25T16:00:00+00:00","is_public":true,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:35:49.633625+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-15