會。\n四、持續重視兒少教育文化並落實在地認同向下扎根。\n五、持續輔導各社區、社團健全發展並能善用各所屬相關資源窗口。\n六、持續爭取民生基礎建設經費包括道路、橋樑、自來水、長照中心等。\n七、持續加強公所團隊服務效能，視民如親。","claim_json":{"phase":1,"platformText":"一、持續爭取醫療資源能量增加並加強落實長期照護資源系統整合。\n二、持續重視鄉內農業基礎打造並加強農業品牌建立、行銷推廣、品質控管等相關農業整合。\n三、持續整合鄉內觀光各項資源，有效活化在地觀光資源增加遊客數與本鄉觀光的能見度，進而帶動提升整體旅遊產業，增加就業機會。\n四、持續重視兒少教育文化並落實在地認同向下扎根。\n五、持續輔導各社區、社團健全發展並能善用各所屬相關資源窗口。\n六、持續爭取民生基礎建設經費包括道路、橋樑、自來水、長照中心等。\n七、持續加強公所團隊服務效能，視民如親。","reviewDecision":{"version":"internal-platform-review-ui-v2","decision":"approve","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T07:36:26.359Z"},"sourceDocument":{"url":"https://eebulletin.cec.gov.tw/111/13%E5%98%89%E7%BE%A9%E7%B8%A3/03%E9%84%89%E9%8E%AE%E5%B8%82%E9%95%B7/%E5%A4%A7%E5%9F%94%E9%84%89%E9%84%89%E9%95%B7.pdf","file":"tmp/cec-elected-platforms/pdfs/38958eee-c337-471f-92c7-d76de5a8a62d-7c177887379901e8.pdf","page":1,"sha256":"8ecc146334f7bc3cb22a6cefb40bb4d7c1a99068b62bcec5e9e631931c7e8d41","cropFile":"tmp/cec-elected-platforms/crops/38958eee-c337-471f-92c7-d76de5a8a62d-8ecc146334f7bc3c-0fdc608d2c0f.png","layoutFile":"tmp/cec-elected-platforms/layouts/38958eee-c337-471f-92c7-d76de5a8a62d-8ecc146334f7bc3c.png","extractionMethod":"ocr_ready_table_geometry"},"electionContext":{"raceId":"92642b81-f694-42c5-b08f-87bdcd474c35","electionId":"74e8049b-6fd3-432f-aa93-8673d7b44fba","candidateId":"38958eee-c337-471f-92c7-d76de5a8a62d"},"publicationGate":{"reason":"Election-scoped CEC platform text accepted; minor transcription errors may remain","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T07:36:26.359Z"},"campaignPlatformReview":{"reason":"Exact person and candidacy were confirmed before publication","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T07:36:26.359Z"}},"confidence_level":"B","review_status":"verified","visibility":"public","source_name":"中央選舉委員會：2022年選舉公報","source_url":"https://eebulletin.cec.gov.tw/111/13%E5%98%89%E7%BE%A9%E7%B8%A3/03%E9%84%89%E9%8E%AE%E5%B8%82%E9%95%B7/%E5%A4%A7%E5%9F%94%E9%84%89%E9%84%89%E9%95%B7.pdf","observed_at":"2022-11-25T16:00:00+00:00","is_public":true,"