進度。\n二 顧農民！請中央加速建設冷鏈包裝加工廠、順暢行銷管道、提供完善農業資訊、提升天然災害救助補貼效率。\n三 顧漁民！強化漁港建設、保護漁民安全。\n四 顧勞工！要求強化職場安全，落實勞動檢查，以保障勞工權益。\n五 顧學生！持續爭取校園內設施改善，包括老舊校舍、廁所、操場及風雨球場，讓教育資源進入屏南。\n六 顧觀光！推動一鄉鎮一特色，以多樣化觀光元素吸引人潮，提升觀光產業產值，保障觀光從業人口權益。\n七 顧全人！要求落實社會住宅興建，加強照顧長輩、幼兒國家養政策、政策減輕年輕人負擔，及身心障礙弱勢照顧。\n八 顧醫療！強化偏鄉醫療，採專案增加診療科別及設備、補足醫護人力，由教學醫院支援偏鄉醫療。\n九 顧客家！要求重視南客，挹注資源發展六堆客家文化暨產業。\n十 顧健康！強化公共衛生政策，推動不分男女免費接種HPV（人類乳突病毒）疫苗，讓台灣HPV防癌政策跟上國際趨勢。","reviewDecision":{"version":"internal-platform-review-ui-v2","decision":"approve","reviewedAt":"2026-08-14T18:00:15.801Z"},"sourceDocument":{"url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/02%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1/113%E5%B9%B4%E7%AC%AC11%E5%B1%86/02%E5%8D%80%E5%9F%9F%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1/14%E5%B1%8F%E6%9D%B1%E7%B8%A3/%E7%AC%AC2%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%80/%E5%B1%8F%E6%9D%B1%E7%B8%A3%E7%AB%8B%E5%A7%94%E7%AC%AC2%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%80.pdf","file":"tmp/cec-representative-platforms/2024-legislator/pdfs/b4542cbb8b41413dc7909e56.pdf","page":1,"sha256":"7d382a25568fa2055e381facdcdb95810dcc5931bb893eb575e8f3373a9ca516","cropFile":"tmp/cec-representative-platforms/2024-legislator/crops/b70de53b-ec25-4ee5-a0b1-665c6addcb39-7d382a25568fa205-746b3aabc46f.png","layoutFile":null,"extractionMethod":"ocr_ready"},"electionContext":{"raceId":"b428322a-b962-4d6b-ba20-96c6918d6268","electionId":"1a787d86-d6e8-44b2-b4c4-b9091c9553c8","candidateId":"b70de53b-ec25-4ee5-a0b1-665c6addcb39"},"publicationGate":{"reason":"Election-scoped CEC platform text accepted; minor transcription errors may remain","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-14T18:00:15.801Z"},"campaignPlatformReview":{"reason":"Exact person and candidacy were confirmed before publication","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-14T18:00:15.801Z"}},"confidence_level":"B","review_status":"verified","visibility":"public","source_name":"中央選舉委員會：2024年選舉公報","source_url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/02%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1/113%E5%